<section id="faq" style="padding: 5rem 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-ink); background-color: var(--color-paper);">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <span class="pill pill-sun" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Clear Answers</span>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
      <p class="text-ink-soft" style="font-size: 1.1rem;">
        Everything you need to know before applying as a brand partner.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-accordion-group">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" data-accordion-trigger>
          <span>Does applying guarantee placement in the box?</span>
          <span class="accordion-icon">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          Application does not guarantee placement. Brands are selected based on product fit, availability, location, box themes, customer appeal, and compatibility with other featured items. If not selected for the next immediate box, your brand will remain in our registry for future seasonal drops.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" data-accordion-trigger>
          <span>Do I need to provide a full-size product?</span>
          <span class="accordion-icon">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          Not necessarily. Generous trial samples, discovery-size portions, vouchers, and specialty full-size goods may all be considered. The item should provide a meaningful, memorable introduction to your brand.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" data-accordion-trigger>
          <span>How many units will I need to provide?</span>
          <span class="accordion-icon">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          Our boxes are produced in focused, limited batches — typically 100 boxes per regional edition run. We will agree upon the exact unit quantity together prior to finalizing the agreement.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" data-accordion-trigger>
          <span>How does the QR code offer work?</span>
          <span class="accordion-icon">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          Every brand feature in the Maker Field Guide includes a dedicated, tracked QR code and coupon code. When subscribers scan it, it takes them directly to your designated landing page, online shop, or special offer page so you can track exact website traffic and attributed sales.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" data-accordion-trigger>
          <span>What happens after I submit my application?</span>
          <span class="accordion-icon">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          Our curation team reviews each application carefully. If your brand is a strong match for an upcoming edition, we will schedule a 15-minute introductory call to discuss product inclusion ideas, inventory timelines, and logistics.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Brand FAQ",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Brand FAQ"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
